## POWER LAW WARNING [RUNTIME ASSERTION: POWER-LAW-MEDIAN-WARNING]

For ALL models above, income distribution follows power law:
- **P10 (bottom 10%):** $0-200/mo — majority fail or earn near-zero
- **P50 (median):** $1K-3K/mo — sustainable but not "large cash flow"
- **P90 (top 10%):** $10K-50K/mo — the "large cash flow" zone
- **P99 (top 1%):** $100K+/mo — exceptional execution + compounding + time

**The "truly large cash flow" ($10K+/mo) requires reaching P90. This typically takes 2-5 years of sustained execution, not model selection alone.** Model choice determines the CEILING, not the floor.

