- Power law: majority of entrants in ANY model earn near-zero. Large cash flow = P90+ execution, takes 2-5 years
- Platform dependency risk for models #10, #15, #16, #18 — own the customer relationship
- Survivorship bias: all examples cited are P99 outcomes. Median outcome for each model is dramatically lower

